{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19198","headline":"和乐天斋戒月满夜对道场偶怀咏 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天斋戒月满夜对道场偶怀咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常修清净去繁华，人识王城长者家。\n案上香烟铺贝叶，佛前灯焰透莲花。\n持斋已满招闲客，理曲先闻命小娃。\n明日若过方丈室，还应问爲法来邪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}